  "name": "Grasping Vine",
  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p><em>Champions Guild Automation:</em> A vine sprouts in a space within 60 ft. Make a melee spell attack against a creature within 30 ft of it: 4d8 Bludgeoning, and the target is pulled up to 30 ft toward the vine (drag it) and Grappled if it's Huge or smaller (escape DC equals your spell save DC). The vine holds one creature at a time (one more per slot level above 4th). Use Lash Again (Bonus Action) on later turns.</p>",
